<title>USA: National Steel names Carl Apel as vp-finance.</title>
<headline>National Steel names Carl Apel as vp-finance.</headline>
<dateline>MISHAWAKA, Ind. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Steel Corp said Tuesday it appointed Carl Apel as vice president-finance. He joined the company in 1986 and has been corporate controller since 1992.</p>
<p>William McDonough, who was acting chief financial officer and treasurer, continues in the position of treasurer.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
